Link against system SQLite, Judy, libsensors and libbacktrace instead of the
copies upstream downloads at build time (SQLite, libbacktrace) or bundles
(Judy, libsensors); SQLite's recover extension is not part of libsqlite3 and
is built from NETDATA_SQLITE_RECOVER_SOURCE_DIR.
Based on https://distfiles.gentoo.org/pub/dev/arthurzam@gentoo.org/net-analyzer/netdata/netdata-2.11.1-system-libs.patch.xz

